      "description": "Stream blockbusters, new originals, exclusive series and hit shows across drama, action, reality, comedy and family favourites. Paramount+ offers a mountain of entertainment that’s captivating in every way.\n\n• New Originals & Exclusive Series -- Meet captivating characters, explore new worlds, and enjoy fan favourites you won’t find anywhere else.\n• Stream Hollywood Films -- Watch the latest blockbusters and new releases.\n• Enjoy Hit Shows & Family Favourites -- Get ready for action-packed adventures the whole family will love. Plus, set up kid-friendly profiles just for the little ones.\n• Never Lose Track of What You Love -- Add shows and movies to My List and pick up where you left off, anytime.\n• Create up to 6 individual profiles for everyone in your household. Have kids? Try our Kids Mode for a safe, tailored viewing experience.\n\nUnlock Even More with the Premium Plan:\n\n• Stream on up to 4 devices at once\n• Ad-free streaming*\n• Enhanced picture & sound with select titles in 4K UHD, HDR10, Dolby Vision & Dolby Atmos\n\nDownload the Paramount+ app and start streaming today.\n\n4K UHD, HDR10, Dolby Vision and Dolby Atmos available on select titles, subject to your internet service & device capabilities. *Excludes live TV (if available). All plans include trailers before/after content & sponsorship (or similar). For material info on your plan, see: pplus.legal/materialinfo.\n\nYour subscription will automatically renew after any applicable promotional period and your Apple ID account will be charged the subscription price on a recurring basis until you cancel. You can cancel your subscription at any time through your Apple ID account settings. If you cancel your subscription, the cancellation will go into effect at the end of your current subscription period, as applicable. You will have continued access to the Paramount+ Service for the remainder of your paid subscription period.\n\nParamount Terms of Use:\nhttps://pplus.legal/terms\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://privacy.paramount.com/policy\n\nChildren's Privacy Policy:\nhttps://privacy.paramount.com/childrens-short",
